## Document the 0.8 deployment upgrade path

Context: OntoBricks 0.8 needs an explicit operator path for both fresh
installations and in-place upgrades from 0.7.x. The existing additive SQL
migration was verified against the canonical registry schema and automatic
Lakebase bootstrap, while deployment documentation was aligned with the live
two-app deploy behavior.

Changes:

1. update_to_0.8.md
   Add the English fresh-install and 0.7.x upgrade guide, including backup,
   automatic and manual migration, verification, rollback, and troubleshooting.
2. README.md
   Link existing 0.7.x operators to the 0.8 update guide.
3. docs/deployment.md
