## Document deploy.config.sh backup on the 0.8 upgrade path

Context: The 0.8 upgrade guide only copied `scripts/deploy.config.sh` in a
one-liner. Pulling 0.8 overwrites local defaults (`DEFAULT_INSTANCE_ID=08x`),
which would create new apps instead of upgrading the live 0.7.x instance.

Changes:

1. update_to_0.8.md
   Spell out backup, restore-after-checkout, keep the live instance knobs,
   and restore the file on rollback.
2. docs/deployment.md
   Point the Updating section at that `deploy.config.sh` backup/restore step.

Modified files:
- update_to_0.8.md
- docs/deployment.md

